@baseUrl = https://demoweb.amkdelivery.com



### Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456789"
}





### Productos (ejecutar después de Login Admin; usa cookies de sesión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles?page=1&limit=10






























### CSRF Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf



### Login Cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Register (requiere captchaToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "names": "Juan",
  "lastnames": "Perez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "document_type": "DNI",
  "document_number": "12345678",
  "phone": "987654321",
  "captchaToken": "dummy"
}
